  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 5th level, a dealer’s connection with the Sense grant him the ability to react to danger before his senses would normally allow him to do so. He cannot be caught flat-footed, nor does he lose his Dex bonus to AC if the attacker is invisible. He still loses his Dexterity bonus to armor class if immobilized. A dealer with this ability can still lose his Dexterity bonus to armor class if an opponent successfully uses the feint action against him.</p>\n<p>If a dealer already has uncanny dodge from a different class, he automatically gains improved uncanny dodge (see below) instead.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/dealer#toc36\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
